    slug: "landlord-compliance-documents-checklist", title: "Landlord Compliance Documents Checklist for England", description: "A practical property-by-property list of safety records, tenancy evidence and local documents landlords should organise.", published: "2026-08-27", updated: "2026-08-27", readMins: 7,
    intro: "A landlord compliance file should answer three questions quickly: what applies to this property, what evidence is current and what needs action next. This checklist organises the main national England records without pretending local and property-specific duties do not exist.",
